		<p importance="default">This actual feature may differ from the illustration.</p>
		<note type="caution">
			<p importance="high">Hanging clothing</p>
			<p>Do not hang heavy clothes, since they may damage the hook.</p>
		</note>
		<note type="warning">
			<p>Do not hang other objects such as hangers or hard objects except clothes. Also, do not put heavy, sharp or breakable objects in the clothing’s pockets. In an accident or when the curtain air bag is inflated, it may cause vehicle damage or body injury.</p>
		</note>
